{"id":17,"slug":"17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Semantic","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?","question_en":"What is the difference between `<div>` and `<section>`?","answer_vi":"`<div>` là **container không mang nghĩa**; `<section>` là **một khối nội dung có chủ đề riêng**.\n\n```html\n<!-- div: chỉ để bọc cho layout -->\n<div class=\"grid\">\n  <section>\n    <h2>Mô tả sản phẩm</h2>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h2>Đánh giá</h2>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n```\n\nQuy tắc quyết định:\n- Chỉ cần chỗ để gắn `display:flex`, padding, background → **`<div>`**.\n- Khối này có **tiêu đề riêng** và có thể xuất hiện trong mục lục của trang → **`<section>`**.\n\nSpec nói rõ: `<section>` **nên luôn có heading**. Một `<section>` không heading thì với screen reader gần như vô dụng, và đúng ra nên là `<div>`.\n\n**Lưu ý:** đổi hết `<div>` thành `<section>` cho \"semantic hơn\" là phản tác dụng — landmark bị loãng, screen reader phải đọc qua hàng chục region vô danh.","answer_en":"`<div>` is a **meaningless container**; `<section>` is a **thematic block of content**.\n\n```html\n<!-- div: purely for layout -->\n<div class=\"grid\">\n  <section>\n    <h2>Product description</h2>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h2>Reviews</h2>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n```\n\nHow to decide:\n- You just need something to hang `display:flex`, padding or a background on → **`<div>`**.\n- The block has **its own heading** and would belong in a page outline → **`<section>`**.\n\nThe spec is explicit: a `<section>` **should always have a heading**. A headingless section is nearly useless to a screen reader and should have been a `<div>`.\n\n**Note:** replacing every `<div>` with `<section>` to be \"more semantic\" backfires — the landmark list gets diluted and screen readers wade through dozens of unnamed regions.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;div&gt;</code> là <strong>container không mang nghĩa</strong>; <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> là <strong>một khối nội dung có chủ đề riêng</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- div: chỉ để bọc cho layout --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Mô tả sản phẩm&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Đánh giá&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- div: chỉ để bọc cho layout --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grid&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Mô tả sản phẩm<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Đánh giá<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Quy tắc quyết định:<br/>- Chỉ cần chỗ để gắn <code>display:flex</code>, padding, background → <strong><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></strong>.<br/>- Khối này có <strong>tiêu đề riêng</strong> và có thể xuất hiện trong mục lục của trang → <strong><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Spec nói rõ: <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> <strong>nên luôn có heading</strong>. Một <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> không heading thì với screen reader gần như vô dụng, và đúng ra nên là <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> đổi hết <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> thành <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> cho \"semantic hơn\" là phản tác dụng — landmark bị loãng, screen reader phải đọc qua hàng chục region vô danh.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>&lt;div&gt;</code> is a <strong>meaningless container</strong>; <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> is a <strong>thematic block of content</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- div: purely for layout --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Product description&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Reviews&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- div: purely for layout --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grid&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Product description<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Reviews<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">How to decide:<br/>- You just need something to hang <code>display:flex</code>, padding or a background on → <strong><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></strong>.<br/>- The block has <strong>its own heading</strong> and would belong in a page outline → <strong><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The spec is explicit: a <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> <strong>should always have a heading</strong>. A headingless section is nearly useless to a screen reader and should have been a <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> replacing every <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> to be \"more semantic\" backfires — the landmark list gets diluted and screen readers wade through dozens of unnamed regions.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — <section>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/section"},{"label":"HTML Standard — the section element","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#the-section-element"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/18-article-va-section-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<article>` và `<section>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/19-header-footer-nav-main-aside-dung-khi-nao","title":"`<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>` dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/20-figure-va-figcaption-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"`<figure>` và `<figcaption>` dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/21-mark-strong-em-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<mark>`, `<strong>`, `<em>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/22-the-time-duoc-su-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Thẻ `<time>` được sử dụng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/23-semantic-html-anh-huong-seo-nhu-the-nao","title":"Semantic HTML ảnh hưởng SEO như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/24-khi-nao-dung-dl-dt-dd","title":"Khi nào dùng `<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`?"}]}